      "text": "[9:27PM] #Mushin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Moshalashi inw Alakara Police Station, ìdí ọ̀rọ̀ down to Olosha.\nOjuwoye moving towards Post office junction, down to Oshodi underneath bridge inward Arena is good.\n\nThe return journey from Bolade-Arena, Oshodi down to Mushin Olosa is good.\n\nOjuwoye to connect Isolo road, Palm Avenue, Oye roundabout to Daleko bridge is good.\n\nReturn journey from Daleko bridge inward Mushin-Isolo is also good.\n\nOfficers are on ground doing the needful. \n\n#FollowLASTMA",
