      "text": "[10:35PM] #Ketu #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth flow from Ojota to Interchange and ascending the bridge to Toll Gate.\nGood traffic from Demuren to Ile-Ile, Iyana School, Kosofe, and Mile 12.\nMoving traffic at Interchange to Tipper Garage and Demuren junction, with minor slowdowns near Demuren junction due to pedestrians and evening rush.\nReturn journey is also smooth with officers managing traffic, no impediments reported.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
